1630
02:01:31,120 --> 02:01:33,680
we approving an action for a private school?

1631
02:01:33,680 --> 02:01:35,520
Could you answer that please?

1632
02:01:35,520 --> 02:01:37,320
I looked that up.

1633
02:01:37,320 --> 02:01:43,720
I knew generally what the situation was but looked up for the statutory background.

1634
02:01:43,720 --> 02:01:51,120
It's found in the Alabama Code section 16, 17, 2 and a few sections following basically

1635
02:01:51,120 --> 02:01:57,980
what the Alabama Code provides for or authorizes the incorporation of educational building

1636
02:01:57,980 --> 02:02:04,920
authorities, which is what this is, as a public corporation and as political subdivisions

1637
02:02:04,920 --> 02:02:11,400
of the state for the purpose of providing ancillary improvements for use in connection

1638
02:02:11,400 --> 02:02:18,000
with educational institutions and to invest those authorities with powers that may be

1639
02:02:18,000 --> 02:02:21,760
necessary for them to accomplish their purpose.

1640
02:02:21,760 --> 02:02:28,520
They include without limitation the power to lease their properties but more importantly,

1641
02:02:28,520 --> 02:02:35,360
in my limited experience here, is for issuing interest-bearing revenue bonds to raise money

1642
02:02:35,360 --> 02:02:39,560
for building the school buildings and things of that nature.

1643
02:02:39,560 --> 02:02:46,440
The city doesn't regulate those entities or participate in their government other than

1644
02:02:46,440 --> 02:02:54,520
being the authority or the governmental entity that when the authority is created approves

1645
02:02:54,520 --> 02:03:00,320
that and there's a statutory provision which I won't bore everyone with with regard to

1646
02:03:00,320 --> 02:03:03,600
that but it's relatively simple and straightforward.

1647
02:03:03,600 --> 02:03:12,800
And then they also approve as the governing body the board of directors, the members of

1648
02:03:12,800 --> 02:03:15,920
the board of directors as that goes.

1649
02:03:15,920 --> 02:03:23,120
So the easy answer is this is state code has set it up for us to do this.

1650
02:03:23,120 --> 02:03:25,960
Any other discussion?

1651
02:03:25,960 --> 02:03:26,960
