3063
03:31:47,840 --> 03:31:53,720
We have to stop prioritizing corporate consolidation and market monopolies over human lives.

3064
03:31:53,720 --> 03:31:58,900
It's time we return to the kind of patient care that inspires people to enter the medical

3065
